---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact Chen Gadi through the website. Anonymous class questions, private course logistics with required email and course, and general inquiries."
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <p class="edition-label">Let’s keep the conversation here</p><h1>
        Get in touch<span class="cv-title-dot">.</span>
      </h1><p>
        Choose the route that fits your question. Replies stay on the website,
        so you can keep the conversation in one place.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <section class="contact-route">
        <p class="academic-kicker">ANONYMOUS CLASS DISCUSSION</p><h2
          class="font-display text-2xl mt-4 mb-4"
        >
          A question for the class?
        </h2><p>
          Ask anonymously, read discussions, and help classmates with anonymous
          replies. Enter your classroom with the code shared in class.
        </p><a href="/students" class="academic-primary mt-6"
          >Anonymous course Q&amp;A ↗</a>
      </section>
      <section class="contact-route">
        <p class="academic-kicker">PRIVATE COURSE LOGISTICS</p><h2
          class="font-display text-2xl mt-4 mb-4"
        >
          Something practical to arrange?
        </h2><p>
          Select your course and enter your email address. Both are required.
          Your details stay within the private request, visible only to you and
          Chen.
        </p><a href="/students?mode=logistics" class="academic-primary mt-6"
          >Write a logistics request ↗</a>
      </section>
      <section class="contact-route">
        <p class="academic-kicker">GENERAL &amp; PERSONAL INQUIRIES</p><h2
          class="font-display text-2xl mt-4 mb-4"
        >
          A private conversation.
        </h2><p>
          For research, collaboration, or other general inquiries, start a
          private conversation. No class code is needed. Personal course
          requests are also available in your classroom.
        </p><a href="/students?course=general" class="academic-secondary mt-6"
          >Open a private conversation ↗</a>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="research-focus mt-8">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mb-3">How to find your reply</h2><p>
        Keep your private recovery code. It restores your conversations on
        another device. For logistics requests, email is collected for
        identification; messages and replies stay on this website. No outgoing
        email is sent.
      </p><a href="/students?mode=requests" class="academic-secondary"
        >My private requests ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
